DESCRIPTION:
	Error message reporting system that reports errors throughout
        the processing of a request; usually in stream modules (i.e.,
        protocol streams and structured streams). A list of errors are
        put into a HTList which can be bound to a request object.

	$Id: hterror.goh,v 1.1 97/04/04 15:54:35 newdeal Exp $

